# SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
# Pad controls check (docs/controls.md), run on ares by
# test/m5/controls_ares.sh: hldemo1, god mode, every weapon (impulse 101,
# test builds), the crowbar then the 9mm handgun selected (slot 1 then
# slot 2: the handgun whatever 101 left active), one handgun shot (a clip
# to reload), then the `padready` stats line; the script's pad input runs
# while the route waits. Syntax: docs/formats/route-bytecode.md.
startmap hldemo1
wait 3
god 1
setpos -489 -295 41 0 0
impulse 101
wait 1
impulse 1
wait 1
impulse 2
wait 1.5
+attack
wait 0.3
-attack
wait 1
stats padready
wait 3600
pass
